<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia falls to 1.770 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia falls to 1.770 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia fell to 1.770 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange - 1.768 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 10	   October 9</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.770		  1.768</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.610 million	 $5.96 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
